OL,3,A'We've waited 73 years to be here' -
OL,4,AWales fans ecstatic after win over New
OL,5,AZealand
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh rugby fans were "fizzing off
OL,8,Ftheir heads" on Saturday night after
OL,9,Fending 73 years of hurt against New
OL,10,FZealand in an epic Nations Championship
OL,11,Fencounter.
OL,13,FThe match at the Principality Stadium
OL,14,Fended 35-28 to the hosts as the All
OL,15,FBlacks' run of 34 successive victories
OL,16,Fagainst Wales - dating back to 1953 -
OL,17,Fcame to a juddering halt in Cardiff.
OL,19,FWales fans were left stunned by a
OL,20,Fresult that came just a week on from
OL,21,Fhaving to grind out a win against
OL,22,FJapan.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
