OL,3,A'We've waited 73 years to be here' -
OL,4,AWales fans ecstatic after win over New
OL,5,AZealand
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince William, patron of the Welsh
OL,8,FRugby Union (WRU) also congratulated
OL,9,Fthe team on the win, saying it was a
OL,10,F"fantastic result".
